Voom includes a modified build of gvproxy from containers/gvisor-tap-vsock.

Upstream source: https://github.com/containers/gvisor-tap-vsock
Upstream revision: 9cfc86f66679ef0feed0f20ba1df558fe2bef5c6
Upstream version: v0.8.9

The Voom project modified this build to add private gateway forwarding and to
isolate guests from host-only gvproxy services. The source changes are in
nix/patches/gvproxy-gateway-forward.patch and
nix/patches/gvproxy-modification-notices.patch in the Voom source repository.

